  and let~$P$ be an~$\ed$-approximation of~$C$. Then for every~$x \in
  \conv \vertices P$ and~$r \geq \varepsilon$ it holds true, that
   egin{equation}
    \haus{P \cap B_r(x)}{C \cap B_r(x)} \leq 2\left(
      \varepsilon+\delta\left(r+
orm{x-v}ight)ight)
