If $ rac{r-\varepsilon}{r+
orm{x-v_1}} < \delta \leq 1$ then \[

orm{p^*-c^*} \leq 
orm{p^*-c_0} \leq 
orm{p^*-x} +

orm{x-c_0} \leq r + \varepsilon \leq 2(\varepsilon + \delta
    (r+
orm{x-v_1})). \] Otherwise, the last inequality is
