    \delta(r
orm{x-v_1})}{
orm{p^*-x}}$. If~${\lambda}^* \leq
   ar{\lambda}$ then $z({\lambda}^*) \in V$ and there
  exists~$c_{{\lambda}^*} \in C$ with~$
orm{z({\lambda}^*) -
    c_{{\lambda}^*}} \leq \varepsilon$. Therefore,
  \[ 
orm{p^*-c^*} \leq 
orm{p^*-z({\lambda}^*)} +

orm{z({\lambda}^*)-c_{{\lambda}^*}} \leq 2 \varepsilon + \delta
